# Q19: Cycles in the parentTransfer graph (transfer IRI returns to itself via parentTransfer+)
PREFIX pcaq: <http://pcaq.local/ns#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT DISTINCT ?xfer ?label ?approved WHERE {
  ?xfer a pcaq:IntercompanyTransfer ; pcaq:parentTransfer+ ?xfer .
  OPTIONAL { ?xfer rdfs:label ?label }
  OPTIONAL { ?xfer pcaq:approvedLoop ?approved }
}
ORDER BY ?xfer
